description: PHY and full PCIe IP (rivet_pcie) rules
globs: rtl/phy/**/*,rtl/top/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# PHY and full IP

- Only `rtl/phy/` and `rtl/top/rivet_pcie` may reference Xilinx PG239.
- PIPE is the sole boundary between `rivet_pcie_ctrl` and PHY.
- Family select via `FPGA_FAMILY` (US+ first, US second).
- Do not check in encrypted IP; stub PHYs are OK until board IP is generated.
- Instance names in top: `u_ctrl`, `u_phy`.
